e <strong>BAD ENDING</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/b3618179b21aebdd5011f8de9d220908.poster.avif?t=1786146168\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/b3618179b21aebdd5011f8de9d220908.webm?t=1786146168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/b3618179b21aebdd5011f8de9d220908.mp4?t=1786146168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to reclaim brain chips is to find injectors capable of penetrating the skull and extracting a chip from your dead body. Isn’t the cycle of life marvelous?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful - everything comes at a price…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/1d3ba153c5d7ebbae58d7b8fb8f0e72c.poster.avif?t=1786146168\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/1d3ba153c5d7ebbae58d7b8fb8f0e72c.webm?t=1786146168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/bf24a97a194b675de1426820c6d83fac.poster.avif?t=1786146168\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/bf24a97a194b675de1426820c6d83fac.webm?t=1786146168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st